  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/12/IMG_0832.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Este lunes 24 de diciembre, Nochebuena, en New Robinson de la calle de San Bernardo en Onda se han sorteado los 20 jamones entre las personas que rellenaron sus papeletas y que estaban en el local, que presentaba un gran ambiente, en los momentos en que una mano inocente las sacaba de la urna.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/newrobinsonnitdenadal18/img_0677.jpg\" alt=\"img_0677\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/newrobinsonnitdenadal18/img_0678.jpg\" alt=\"img_0678\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/newrobinsonnitdenadal18/img_0679.jpg\" alt=\"img_0679\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/newrobinsonnitdenadal18/img_0681.jpg\" alt=\"img_0681\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/newrobinsonnitdenadal18/img_0684.jpg\" alt=\"img_0684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/newrobinsonnitdenadal18/img_0803.jpg\" alt=\"img_0803\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/newrobinsonnitdenadal18/img_0804.jpg\" alt=\"img_0804\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/newrobinsonnitdenadal18/img_0806.jpg\" alt=\"img_0806\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/newrobinsonnitdenadal18/img_0807.jpg\" alt=\"img_0807\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://